{"id":"3fcb8e5cd222bcf0d8e16ef68a521455a9e1d536","url":"https://www.v2ex.com/t/1240783","title":"苹果美区礼品卡升级 gpt 触发审核","site_name":"Info Flow","source":"V2EX (创意工作者社区)","byline":"BlackSnow","excerpt":"Apple - @BlackSnow - 背景1. 美区账号 绑的国内电话 之前购买付费项目没有问题（ 24 年左右） 用的美区礼品卡2. 这次咸鱼买的礼品卡3. 账单地址改到免税一下出现了审查 客服没告知原因 话里话外推","content_html":"<DIV class=\"page\" id=\"readability-page-1\"><div><p>背景<br>1. 美区账号 绑的国内电话 之前购买付费项目没有问题（ 24 年左右） 用的美区礼品卡<br>2. 这次咸鱼买的礼品卡<br>3. 账单地址改到免税</p><p>一下出现了审查 客服没告知原因 话里话外推荐我比较急的话就再注册一个账号 正常流程 72 小时![issue<br>]( <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://i.imgur.com/36KbZpe.jpeg\" rel=\"nofollow noopener\"><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/36KbZpe.jpeg\" rel=\"noreferrer\"></a>)</p></div><div>\n    <div><P><a href=\"/tag/美区\"><li></li> 美区</a><a href=\"/tag/礼品卡\"><li></li> 礼品卡</a><a href=\"/tag/审核\"><li></li> 审核</a></P><p><span>9 replies &#160;<strong>•</strong> &#160;2026-09-10 07:28:30 +08:00</span>\n    </p></div>\n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        \n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18067985\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/de30/859d/190701_normal.png?m=1749289695\" alt=\"shakaraka\" data-uid=\"190701\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>3</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/shakaraka\">shakaraka</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 19:06:28 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>为什么不在官网买？礼品卡、信用卡是风控最严的。而且来路不明的卡你也用。礼品卡用国内卡买不了的话，用海外银行卡买就行了，例如港卡</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18068072\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/fb5f/2e03/66951_normal.png?m=1413945070\" alt=\"aero99\" data-uid=\"66951\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>4</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/aero99\">aero99</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 19:48:19 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>咸鱼礼品卡是重灾区，然后又改了账单地址</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18068107\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/99a9/0e80/243959_normal.png?m=1779255512\" alt=\"q534\" data-uid=\"243959\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>5</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/q534\">q534</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 20:02:24 +08:00\">1 day ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>容易黑号，得不偿失啊。官方也差不了几个钱</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18068303\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/0a45/59b7/276400_normal.png?m=1724161474\" alt=\"YanSep\" data-uid=\"276400\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>6</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/YanSep\">YanSep</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-09 21:29:49 +08:00\">22h 39m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>闲鱼买卡，楼主糊涂啊</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18068588\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/df8b/0031/447571_normal.png?m=1575639548\" alt=\"katoyu\" data-uid=\"447571\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>7</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/katoyu\">katoyu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-10 00:34:45 +08:00\">19h 35m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>咸鱼，淘宝，号没有了。。。。你官网充值不就好啦，贪图便宜。。。现在不是 gpt 的问题，你这号估计快了。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18068750\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/gravatar/e2a6bcce9a6c593b127b8a420746ff6a?s=48&d=retro\" alt=\"kurisu\" data-uid=\"402788\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>8</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/kurisu\">kurisu</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-10 07:27:11 +08:00\">12h 42m ago via iPhone</span> \n                    \n                    <p>上面一些回复有点过于夸张了，闲鱼买卡确实可能是黑卡，但这个提示又不一定是黑卡才会触发。这是苹果很常见的风控，提交审核后 72 小时就恢复了。比较麻烦的是经常会出现，很影响使用。</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n    \n        \n        <div id=\"r_18068753\">\n        \n        <table>\n            <tr>\n                <td><img src=\"https://cdn.v2ex.com/avatar/3b19/99c4/393792_normal.png?m=1724033926\" alt=\"Master1993\" data-uid=\"393792\"></td>\n                <td></td>\n                <td><p><span>9</span></p>\n                    \n                    <strong><a href=\"/member/Master1993\">Master1993</a></strong> &#160; &#160; &#160;<span title=\"2026-09-10 07:28:30 +08:00\">12h 41m ago</span> \n                    \n                    <p>官网礼品卡随便买，去买第三方来路不明的卡，不怕自己的账号被连坐，直接扬了嘛。。。<br>官网 web 或者 Apple store 直接用国内卡买就行，甚至还能调用 applepay （浏览器仅限于 safari 内）</p>\n                </td>\n            </tr>\n        </table>\n        </div>\n    \n    \n\n\n</div></DIV>","content_text":"背景1. 美区账号 绑的国内电话 之前购买付费项目没有问题（ 24 年左右） 用的美区礼品卡2. 这次咸鱼买的礼品卡3. 账单地址改到免税一下出现了审查 客服没告知原因 话里话外推荐我比较急的话就再注册一个账号 正常流程 72 小时![issue]( ) 美区 礼品卡 审核9 replies • 2